From e10371e0d38887fa5fe935b0d5a5b1ad0e0b3466 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: exploitizm <351399878+exploitizm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 06:07:04 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] radv/ps5: mesh shaders of emulated task draws run as compute

On this GPU (GFX10.1, no CP mesh dispatch) an emulated task draw's mesh
workgroups are drawn as an NGG "fast launch" draw, a vertex a workgroup. That
draw can stop the GPU: every mesh wave finishes, but the draw never reaches
end of pipe, with PA, SX and SPI busy and GE, SC and CB idle. It depends on
what ran before (the same meshlet passes once and hangs later; one
serialized workgroup can hang it), and no change to the mesh shader, its
registers or the draw packets avoids it (EglantinePS5
docs/MESH_HANG_HANDOFF.md).

A pipeline with an emulated task shader now runs its mesh shader as a
compute pass, and the pipeline's hardware vertex shader becomes a copy that
rasterizes what it wrote (radv_mesh_compute.c, as radv_gs_compute runs
geometry shaders):

- The compute pass is the mesh shader with its outputs lowered to a slot of
  memory per mesh workgroup: the vertex and primitive counts, the per-vertex
  outputs as vec4s and the triangles' indices. Its workgroup ID, grid, draw
  ID and task payload come from its task workgroup's record, which it finds
  by binary search over the chunk's records.
- The copy vertex shader draws 3 vertices per primitive slot as a triangle
  list, a degenerate triangle for each unused one.
- Per chunk of task workgroups: the task shader, a records pass
  (radv_meta_mesh_compute_records: a record a task workgroup with the mesh
  workgroups before it, and each pass's dispatch and draw), then per pass of
  as many mesh workgroups as the slots hold, the compute pass and the copy
  draw. A chunk holds up to 65536 mesh workgroups; the rest are left out.
- Direct, indirect and indirect count draws.
- The buffer (128 MiB) is made with the first pipeline with a task shader.
  These pipelines are not cached, and are not taken from the cache either.

First: triangles, per-vertex outputs that are positions and generic
varyings, no per-primitive outputs but the indices, no multiview; other mesh
shaders keep the hardware path. /data/eglantineps5/radv-mesh-compute.txt
saying 0 turns it off.

Ocarina of Time (0400486024dec000), which stopped the GPU right after its
intro, plays.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
